- **P5:** Re-confirm the MFDual `self.*_inferencer =` mutation sites (F8: `:363,378,567,574,598`) so **B5** re-points them to `call_state` writes behind the accessor seam (rewrite both sides together; do not delete logic).
- **P6:** Confirm the WorkGraph gather site copies context per task (so per-node `enter_node_scope` is the isolation mechanism) and audit any sync `parallel_infer` thread sites use `contextvars.copy_context().run(...)`.
- **P7:** Capture the **retry/two-tier baseline** on current code (attempt-1 winner survives attempt-2 malformed) before B4 re-points the resets (AF4 gate).

